          "resource": {
            "@id": "https://dms-data.stanford.edu/data/manifests/Parker/nb647fd0133/res/5483d3fd-fa2d-4b77-bebc-b515da248829",
            "@type": "cnt:ContentAsText",
            "format": "text/plain",
            "chars": "Musical notation for antiphon, verse and responsory. Begins imperfectly in antiphon for Magnificat at First Vespers for the Seventh Sunday after Pentecost: (Unxerunt Salomonem Sadoc sacerdos et Nathan pro)pheta regem in Gihon: et procedentes laeti dixerunt uiuat rex Salomon seculorum. This differs slightly from the wording of the antiphon in the 1568 editio princeps of the Breviarium Romanum"
          }
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://dms-data.stanford.edu/data/manifests/Parker/nb647fd0133/annotation/e8977721-173d-48a4-a1d0-2b94e6393e03",
